v 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T14:58:53-08:00","id":34623,"title":"","content":"Santa could be many things (or nothing) - I've seen versions suggesting he's a Changeling or something connected to them, a Marauder Mage or a creation of magical belief, a forgotten god... You can find quite a few options in <a href=\"http://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?711389-World-of-Darkness-Is-there-a-Santa-Claus\" target=\"_blank\">this RPGnet thread</a>.<br /> <br /> The writers avoided a definitive interpretation of Jesus, including some plot hooks across the various game lines but ultimately leaving that up to individual Storytellers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T15:43:44-08:00","id":34638,"title":"","content":"JC could have been a Mage. Albeit possibly Marauder there at the end. His Avatar being called God.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T17:01:11-08:00","id":34666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Big Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/34606-so-what-happend-with-jesus-and-is-santa-a-changeling?p=34620#post34620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno about the late, great JC, but Santa is obviously a Get of Fenris. &gt;<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's funny you say that. As there's a whole anthology of stories about werewolves on Christmas called: <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Wolfsbane-Mistletoe-Charlaine-Harris/dp/0441017622\" target=\"_blank\">Wolfsbane and Mistletoe</a>.<br /> And yes, it does have a story where Santa Claus can change into a wolf, along with his associate that punishes bad kids.<br /> <br /> Basically why Christmas has anything to do with werewolves is because of a <a href=\"http://werewolftheory.blogspot.com/2012/03/ways-of-becoming-werewolf.html\" target=\"_blank\">superstition about being born on Dec. 25th</a>. It was bad for you to be born on the same day as &quot;JC&quot; and so anyone born on that day was cursed to be werewolves. But they could be cured by the the ritual of &quot;shoeing&quot;.<br /> The other holiday associated with werewolves is Valentine's Day, which was previously known as Lupercalia by the Romans.<br /> <br /> I know that Santa Claus also represents Odin or &quot;Yule Father&quot;. And knowing the Fenris... they won't like that at all.<br /> <br /> I can see Santa Claus as a totem as well or under a different name for a catch-all totem on the concept of giving.<br /> <br /> <b><u>For vampires to get into the act:</u></b> Christmas and <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Mithras\" target=\"_blank\">Mithra </a>were competing for the same day, with Christmas taking over in the end. Yeah, JC wasn't born on Dec. 25th. They just moved the date to the same date as the Feast of Mithra since they hated the Romans so much. [<b>See also:</b> Valentine's Day created the day before Lupercalia. At least now, Lupercalia is 50% off of chocolate day.]<br /> So whenever O'Reilly and his poor ilk goes on rants about being offended over something as silly as &quot;Happy Holidays&quot;, I hope I can respond back to those cranks with, &quot;Happy Immortal Sun God Day!&quot; then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T17:32:09-08:00","id":34675,"title":"","content":"For My Chuuboverse I have Santa as the Ghost of Odin after Ragnarok who took a kinder role leading a group of Alfar/Dwarves in the Northpole to carve a disproportionate amount of lil wooden reindeer and crap for the world.<br /> <br /> Though Jesus... it would have to depend on the game and the Players, that can be a touchy subject...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T17:49:05-08:00","id":34685,"title":"","content":"for my players, father christmas IS real. I havent stated if he is a mage or not..But his figure and image was bought by The Syndicate as an attempt to keep him in check..But they only grew him more powerful!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","va